# Project Overview

This is a blog platform monorepo with two workspaces:

- `client/` - React 19 + Vite 6 SPA (JavaScript/JSX, no TypeScript)
- `server/` - Express 5 + Mongoose API (ESM, `"type": "module"`)

## Stack Guardrails

Do not introduce these unless explicitly requested:

- No TypeScript (the codebase is plain JS/JSX)
- No `@tanstack/react-query` (custom `useApiQuery`/`useApiMutation` hooks are used)
- No Redux / Zustand (global state lives in `AppContext`)
- No Prettier config (formatting follows existing files)

## Collaboration Norms

- Match the conventions of neighboring files over personal preference.
- Run `npm run lint` in `client/` before finishing client-side changes.
- Never commit secrets. `.env` files stay local; only `.env.example` is tracked.
- Keep changes scoped; prefer editing existing files over adding new abstractions.
